libcrace: a holder killed while running released malloc, and its taker's task lived
libcrace: getenv with a kill pending took the free libc lock with no entry
libcrace: no task-private heap with a contained fault, so the dead malloc holder arms did not run
libcrace: printf beside the malloc lock 1
libcrace: a printf completed while malloc was held
libcrace: main's heap ran out at its end
